    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d884">

                <pb facs="0954" n="944" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg944"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/6–249: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Peiping</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Clubb</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-06-02T17:00:00+08:00">June 2, 1949—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 3—1:26 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>925. ReDeptel 300, May 17.<anchor n="77" xml:id="d884-f1"/> Presented May 29 to
                    Chang Tsung-ping (see Contel 912, May 31<anchor n="75" xml:id="d884-f2"/>) memo
                    based on Depreftel setting <pb facs="0955" n="945" xml:id="pg945"/> forth
                    position re GATT as instructed, for presentation to Minister Industry and
                    Commerce.</p>
                <p>Chang informed me today he did not present memo or detailed contents to
                        Yao<anchor n="78" xml:id="d884-f3"/> but discussed matter in general terms
                    by phone and was informed Communists had abrogated GATT tariff because agreement
                    was one of treaties signed by Kmt<anchor n="79" xml:id="d884-f4"/> government,
                    that matter could perhaps be given consideration again at such time Communist
                    government recognized.</p>
                <p>Chang Tung-sun present at today’s conversation re subject.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 925; repeated Nanking 605, OffEmb Canton 141, Shanghai 615,
                    Tientsin 55.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clubb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
